[Music]  in hubie halloween adam sandler's  stupidly hilarious antics are more  accessible than ever with viewers of all  ages able to laugh along with this  halloween themed comedy  but hubie halloween contains some  tidbits that will only be picked up on  by older viewers  especially those familiar with sandler's  previous movies mild spooky spoilers  follow  adam sandler is known not only for the  familiar faces that show up on screen in  his films  but also for having a consistent group  of creatives behind the scenes writing  and directing his comic escapades  returning for hubie halloween is  frequent co-writer tim hurley  who has collaborated with sandler on  prior classics billy madison  happy gilmore the wedding singer and  more while his cadre of frequent  directors includes dennis dugan frank  karachi  and peter seagal for huby sandler  reunites with another of his frequent  collaborators  director stephen brill who helmed little  nikki mr deeds  the do-over and sandy wechsler brill has  also brought his comedic direction to  non-sandler projects like heavyweights  without a paddle  and drill bit taylor sandler is nothing  if not loyal to his collaborators and  brill's work is a perfect match for the  hijinx required for huby halloween  yes the first face you see in hubie  halloween is certainly not one you would  expect but for long time sandler fans  it's a wonderful surprise to kick things  off  our story begins at the nearby mental  asylum where the  inciting event of the film takes place  the escape of a mental patient who's  been locked up for many years  and the orderly who comes to check on  this patient is someone you might recall  from a previous sandler film special  delivery  for mr loon e tunes it's none other than  fellow comedy luminary ben stiller  reprising his role of hal  l the fantastically deranged orderly who  tortured happy's beloved grandmother  in 1996's happy gilmore he definitely  should have lost his license by now  but all these years later hal l is back  still  as unhinged as ever to introduce us to  the spooktacular world that this film  has in store  if we've learned anything from adam  sandler movies like grownups and its  sequel  the comedies released by happy madison  productions seem to sit halfway between  genuine attempts at telling funny  stories and thinly veiled excuses for  the actor to hang out in fun locations  with his friends  qb halloween certainly falls more into  the former category but as per usual  sandler is joined by an impressive  cohort of comedy compatriots to fill out  the supporting cast  joining in this go-around are sandler  mainstays kevin james is the local  police chief  steve buseme is the new next-door  neighbor with the terrifying secret  tim meadows and maya rudolph his old  classmates of hubies  and sandler's happy gilmore co-star  julie bowen as huby's long time crush  violet valentine  it isn't just the larger supporting cast  that's filled with great comedians  even the smallest one-line cameos are  delivered by stars who bring their  a-game to the latest entry in the  sandler verse  ensuring that each scene is as much fun  for us as it looks like it was for the  actors bringing these scenes to life  what are you doing i'm officiating a  funeral on halloween  people die every day dummy they don't  skip holidays even april fool's day  shut it a few to watch out for stand-up  comedian george wallace plays the  extremely stubborn town mayor  while breaking bad favorite lavelle  crawford shows up as a hilariously  despondent farmer  in a blink and you'll miss it moment  colin quinn pops up as a heavily made-up  janitor  and saturday night live veterans kenan  thompson mikey day  and melissa villasenor are all able to  find their way into the proceedings  then there's shaquille o'neal whose role  in huby halloween winds up being  slightly different than you might expect  throughout much of the film hubie is  seen listening to the local radio  station wtch  specifically enjoying the dulcet tones  of the spooky  seductively voiced disc jockey known  only as aurora  well all you witters and warlocks the  daylight has faded and you know what  that means  halloween in salem is in full effect  in a classic comedy spin that maybe we  should have seen coming  that voice actually belongs to none  other than shaq himself  creating a visual dissonance that makes  for one of the film's goofier comic  premises  and one of the film's more unexpected  cameo appearances critics may not always  like his movies but people clearly enjoy  working with adam sandler  while hal-el's appearance provides  evidence that qb halloween takes  place in the happy gilmore universe  there seems to be firm proof that this  film shares a world with  another early career defining sandler  hit qb dubois  is something close to the town pariah  even the local kids know that making fun  of huby is a salem tradition  and a certain salem child appears to be  part of a family that knows  a little too much about making fun of  adam sandler characters  you can faintly hear it early on but  when a group of kids who've been  harassing hubie start to ride off on  their bikes  you can hear one of them yell  that's right it's yet another member of  the accursed o'doyle family from billy  madison who made billy's life a living  hell  they've somehow found their way to salem  to continue their tradition of picking  on adam sandler characters  but as always the guy sandler plays  winds up triumphant in the end  one of the biggest mysteries throughout  qb halloween is the identity of the  escaped mental patient roaming the  streets of salem wearing a pig mask  as he continues to wander through the  town citizens are being kidnapped  left and right and only huby has the  wherewithal to try and solve this  mystery once and for all  suffice it to say major spoilers are  coming up for anyone who doesn't already  know who this mystery asylum escapee  really is  if you know your adam sandler comedies  you know that there is a certain sandler  collaborator whose name has yet to  appear on this list  and for good reason hiding behind that  pig mask is asylum escapee richie  hartman  played by none other than rob schneider  one of sandler's most frequent comedic  co-stars  his late appearance in the film sets us  up for the final shocking revelation of  who's been causing all the mischief in  salem  a mystery you'll just have to watch qb  halloween to solve  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

